* Why GPUs?

- In October 2025, NVIDIA became the first company worth 5 trillion US dollars
- Every large language model is trained on GPUs and runs on GPUs
- Originally, a GPU was just a graphics card for games

Why? What is so special about a graphics card?

: Zeit: 3 Minuten (Block 1, Aufhänger)
: Kurz sammeln lassen: Wer hat eine Grafikkarte? Wofür?
: Quelle: CNN, 2025-10-29: https://www.cnn.com/2025/10/29/tech/nvidia-5-trillion-valuation-ai

* History: Which problems made GPUs important?

* History: My youth

- *1989,* *Stunt* *Car* *Racer* *(C64):* filled 3D graphics with about 5 to 6 frames per second
- *1993,* *Doom* *on* *a* *386* *DX-25:* 4.6 frames per second
- *1996,* *Quake* *on* *a* *486* *DX2/66:* 8 frames per second
- *Quake* *on* *a* *486* *DX4/100:* 11 frames per second

Every pixel is computed by the CPU, and that at only 320 × 200 pixels.

*1997,* *the* *same* *486* *DX4/100* *with* *a* *3dfx* *Voodoo* *graphics* *card:* about 20 frames per second, at 640 × 480 pixels. Twice the frame rate at twice the resolution.

: Zeit: 12 Minuten (Block 2, Historie). Jede Station mit dem Problem, das den nächsten Schritt erzwungen hat.
