: Quake-Zahlen (Timedemo, 320 x 200, ohne Sound): i486 DX2/66 7,8 fps, i486 DX4/100 11,2 fps, Pentium 75 20,0 fps, Pentium 100 26,7 fps.
: Quelle: thandor.net, Doom-Benchmark (i386 DX25: 4,60 fps): https://thandor.net/benchmark/32
: Quelle: thandor.net, Quake-Benchmark: https://thandor.net/benchmark/33
